Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot11_Bakudankabe/z_bg_spot11_bakudankabe.c.

Provenance comments accompany the definition and every header declaration,
so the name can be re-derived or overturned later. See
tasks/reference/ocarina/decomp-renaming.md.
---
 .../ovl_Bg_Spot11_Bakudankabe/z_bg_spot11_bakudankabe.c    | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot11_Bakudankabe/z_bg_spot11_bakudankabe.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot11_Bakudankabe/z_bg_spot11_bakudankabe.c
